{"id":"665480","name":"红糖开花馒头","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/665480/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"红糖","amount":"120克"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5克"},{"name":"开水","amount":"260克"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪油","amount":"10克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克开水倒入120克红糖中，搅拌至融化。","img":"images/665480/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红糖水晾至温热（36度左右），加入酵母。","img":"images/665480/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665480/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入面粉中。","img":"images/665480/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌成大面絮，加入10克猪油。","img":"images/665480/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下手揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/665480/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"不用发酵，直接移至面垫上，再次揉光滑。","img":"images/665480/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搓成长条。","img":"images/665480/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"用手揪成小剂子（70～80克左右）。","img":"images/665480/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"断面朝上，稍微整理一下形状。","img":"images/665480/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"顶部撒上红糖碎。","img":"images/665480/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"生胚就好了。","img":"images/665480/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"依次摆入蒸锅，中间留出空隙，温暖处发酵至两倍大，现在温度高，40分钟左右就好了。","img":"images/665480/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"凉水上锅，出汽后蒸12分钟，再关火，虚蒸3分钟左右就好了。","img":"images/665480/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蓬松暄软，个个开花。","img":"images/665480/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"营养又健康。","img":"images/665480/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图来一张。","img":"images/665480/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"来，尝尝哦。","img":"images/665480/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}